My first loss of a (for me) great character to remarkable stupidity:

Valk, only level 7, but wielding (version 3.0) a +2 blessed rustproof
Excalibur with AC -9.  Maybe not remarkble for a Nethack God, but one of 
my best characters so far.  I hadn't read many of my scrolls yet, but I 
had two scrolls titled the same thing.  I tried reading one, hoping for 
maybe identify.

  What creature would you like to genocide?

Now, I know mumakils aren't top on most people's genocide list, but they 
always give me trouble.  Of course, I had neglected to check the blessed/
cursed/status of the scroll (and after all, before reading it, I hadn't 
known it was a scroll of Genocide).

  Sent in some mumakils.

AAAAigh!  Eight of them!  I was very proud of my character for being able 
to kill three.  The fourth one got me while I was praying.  Worse yet, 
on my possessions list it identified one of my other scrolls as teleportation!
That Valk might have been in the castle by now.

Happy Hacking.


